{"id":"H0461","lemma":"אֱלִיעֶ֫זֶר","transliteration":"eliezer","sayIt":"e-li-E-zer","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Eliezer","meaning":"A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, only mentioned at Gen.15.2\n§ Eliezer = \"God is help\"\n1) Abraham's Damascene servant\n2) a son of Moses\n3) a Benjamite\n4) a priest who helped move the ark\n5) a Reubenite\n6) a prophet who spoke to Jehoshaphat\n7) a Levite chief\n8) son of Harim\n9) priest with foreign wife","glosses":["eliezer","eliezer—the priests","through eliezer included","then eliezer"],"count":13,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-15","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"is Eliezer","kjv":"Eliezer"}},{"chapterId":"exo-18","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eliezer","kjv":"was Eliezer"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eliezer","kjv":"and Eliezer"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-15","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Eliezer—the priests","kjv":"and Eliezer"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Eliezer","kjv":"and Eliezer"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Eliezer","kjv":"of Eliezer"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-26","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"through Eliezer included","kjv":"by Eliezer"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-27","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Eliezer","kjv":"was Eliezer"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-20","v":37,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Eliezer","kjv":"Then Eliezer"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-8","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eliezer","kjv":"I for Eliezer"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-10","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eliezer","kjv":"and Eliezer"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-10","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Eliezer"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-10","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eliezer","kjv":"Eliezer"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 15:2","note":"Abram said, “Lord Yahweh, what will you give me, since I go childless, and he who will inherit my estate is Eliezer of Damascus?”","source":"web"},{"ref":"Exodus 18:4","note":"The name of the other was Eliezer, for he said, “My father’s God was my help and delivered me from Pharaoh’s sword